### Manualny scenariusz regresyjny: promocja TICKET
### Uzupelnij baseUrl, tokeny i ID zgodnie ze srodowiskiem testowym.

@baseUrl = https://api.hello-poland.pl/v1
@helpdeskToken = HELP_DESK_JWT
@marketToken = MARKET_JWT
@campaignId = 1
@normalAtnaId = 2055
@promoAtnaId = 3001
@sightEventId = 411
@code = VISA-TEST-001
@reservationToken = TOKEN_Z_VALIDATE_CODE
@orderHash = HASH_Z_POST_MARKET_ORDERS

### 1. Helpdesk tworzy kampanie TICKET jako DRAFT
POST {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Promocja VISA test",
  "promotionType": "TICKET",
  "scopeType": "MANUAL",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "validFrom": "2026-08-01T00:00:00",
  "validTo": "2026-08-31T23:59:59",
  "ticketValidTo": "2026-12-31T23:59:59",
  "globalLimit": 2000,
  "codeLimit": 1,
  "requiredTicketQuantity": 1,
  "grantedTicketQuantity": 1
}

### 1a. Helpdesk dodaje/generuje kody dla kampanii
POST {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions/{{campaignId}}/codes
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeType": "ONE_TIME",
  "codes": ["{{code}}"]
}

### 1b. Helpdesk opcjonalnie eksportuje kody kampanii do CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions/{{campaignId}}/codes/export
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}

### 1c. Helpdesk sprawdza oferty wybrane do generowania pul
POST {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions/{{campaignId}}/ticket-pools/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetSetup": {
    "sightEventIds": [{{sightEventId}}]
  },
  "ticketPoolSetup": {
    "ticketPrice": 100,
    "availableTicketsNumber": 10,
    "wholeDay": true,
    "isCyclic": true
  }
}

### 1d. Helpdesk generuje pule promocyjne
POST {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions/{{campaignId}}/ticket-pools/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetSetup": {
    "sightEventIds": [{{sightEventId}}]
  },
  "ticketPoolSetup": {
    "ticketPrice": 100,
    "availableTicketsNumber": 10,
    "wholeDay": true,
    "isCyclic": true
  }
}

### 1e. Helpdesk uruchamia kampanie po akceptacji
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions/{{campaignId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Portal waliduje kod i rezerwuje uzycie
POST {{baseUrl}}/market/promotions/validate-code
Authorization: Bearer {{marketToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{code}}",
  "cartItems": [
    {
      "id": {{normalAtnaId}},
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Portal sklada zamowienie standardowa usluga, juz z biletem promocyjnym
POST {{baseUrl}}/market/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{marketToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promotionReservationToken": "{{reservationToken}}",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": {{normalAtnaId}},
      "quantity": 1,
      "date": "2026-08-30T00:00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": {{promoAtnaId}},
      "quantity": 1,
      "date": "2026-08-30T00:00:00"
    }
  ],
  "details": {
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "Promotion",
    "phone": "500000000"
  }
}

### 4a. Helpdesk moze recznie potwierdzic zamowienie na testach
POST {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/orders/{{orderHash}}/sudoAck
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}

### 4b. Po potwierdzeniu uzycie kodu powinno miec status USED
GET {{baseUrl}}/helpdesk/promotions/{{campaignId}}/redemptions
Authorization: Bearer {{helpdeskToken}}

### 5. Wariant negatywny: ponowna walidacja kodu jednorazowego powinna zwrocic INVALID/CODE_ALREADY_USED
POST {{baseUrl}}/market/promotions/validate-code
Authorization: Bearer {{marketToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{code}}",
  "cartItems": [
    {
      "id": {{normalAtnaId}},
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
